flowchart LR
    A[Broker creates Offer] --> B{Amount and date valid?}
    B -- No --> C[Validation error]
    B -- Yes --> D[Offer Status = Submitted]
    D --> E{Offer Amount >= 500000?}
    E -- No --> F[Normal Offer lifecycle]
    E -- Yes --> G[Submit for approval]
    G --> H[Offer locked]
    H --> I{Manager decision}
    I -- Approve --> J[Status = Accepted]
    I -- Reject --> K[Status = Rejected]
    K --> L[Offer unlocked]
    J --> M[Ready for close and reporting]
    F --> M
    M --> N[Agentforce can summarize and guide broker]
